{
  "_comment": [
    "iTerm2 Dynamic Profiles - source of truth for the terminal profile.",
    "Not loaded by iTerm2 directly: `dutils theme` merges `common` into each",
    "entry of `profiles`, adds the Gruvbox colours for the current terminal mode",
    "and writes ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles/dotfiles-gruvbox.json.",
    "Edit here, then run `dutils theme apply`. Keys are iTerm2's own profile keys.",
    "`_default: true` marks the profile scripts/setup/iterm.sh makes the default."
  ],
